-bottom: 0px; font-size: 12px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot; !important;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: 12px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot; !important;\"><b>15.<span style=\"background-color: rgb(245, 245, 245); white-space: pre-wrap;\">查看当前用户（自己）权限：</span></b></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: 12px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot; !important;\"><b><span style=\"background-color: rgb(245, 245, 245); white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br></span></b></p><pre style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: 12px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5 !important;\">show grants;</span></pre><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: 12px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot; !important;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: 12px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot; !important;\"><b>16.<span style=\"background-color: rgb(245, 245, 245); white-space: pre-wrap;\">查看其他 MySQL 用户权限：</span></b></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: 12px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot; !important;\"><b><span style=\"background-color: rgb(245, 245, 245); white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br></span></b></p><pre style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: 12px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5 !important;\">show grants </span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); line-height: 1.5 !important;\">for</span> admin<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); line-height: 1.5 !important;\">@localhost</span>;</pre><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: 12px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot; !important;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: 12px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot; !important;\"><b>17.<span style=\"font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;